# --- Cloudron/agent working files (never publish) ---
.claude/
scratchpad/
*.local
*.local.md
docs/*.local.md

# --- Per-phase handoff / working notes (local-only, never published) ---
phase-notes/

# --- Upstream source checkout (investigation only; never built-from-here, never published) ---
upstream-lmnr/

# --- Local-only planning + reference docs (box-specific hostnames/identities; never published) ---
# Glob, not a fixed list: the 0.1.5 round found a second foundation doc
# (laminar-backup-snapshot-foundation.md) sitting untracked but UNignored, i.e. one `git add .` away
# from publishing a host name. Any new *foundation*.md is caught by default now.
*foundation*.md
cloudron-packaging-field-guide-*.md

# --- Logo working files (logo.png is the tracked, canonical copy) ---
logo-src/

# --- Secrets / tokens (defensive; real tokens live OUTSIDE the repo) ---
.anonymize-list
*token*.txt
*.secret
*.secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Build / OS cruft ---
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
